WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:02.800
Inukami.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.300
Beasts with great spiritual powers.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:11.640
They look like dogs, but can also take human form.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:16.980
Inukami exist to vanquish evil, to deliver justice.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.380
Together with a clan called Inukami Users,

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:27.260
they fight against the evils ravaging this world.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.170
I know it's sad to be dumped.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.870
But you don't belong here.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.810
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.780
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.740
I won't forgive you.

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:20.410
I got this.
Teleport.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.090
What is this?

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.060
Evil Fire.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.040
Next time, find a better love.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.840
Keita, let's go home.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.180
Yeah.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:06.460
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.830
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:16.800
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:33.250
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:40.360
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:47.000
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:54.500
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:59.240
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:03.080
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:06.380
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:12.020
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:16.330
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:19.530
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:25.800
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.540
Don't Mind Being Naked!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.810
"Don't Mind Being Naked!"
Don't Mind Being Naked!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.010
Don't Mind Being Naked!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:36.150
Keita, hurry up.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.610
I can't hold it anymore.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.920
Yoko, stop it.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.550
You're doing it now?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.120
Well, I mean...

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:49.530
Look, it's already like this.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.230
Yoko
Keita Kawahira
Wow, that's amazing.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:57.230
Don't stare at it. You're scaring me.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:01.840
I can't hold it back if you show it this much.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:07.140
I've been waiting for a long time to do this with you, Keita.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.150
But, I also have to prepare myself.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.550
Don't say that.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.750
You were looking forward to it.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.260
Hurry up, or I'll do it alone.

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:22.760
Come on. Doing it alone is boring.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:26.700
I know. That's why
I'm inviting you, Keita.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.760
Come on, let's go together.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.900
Cherry blossom viewing.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.970
That park was in full bloom.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:36.240
Look, the riverside too.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.040
Cherry blossoms...

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:40.280
I'll think about it.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:45.010
If you come along,

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.720
I'll service you so much!

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:50.390
Service?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.990
Right. I'll do lots of good things.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:55.790
Well, then...

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.290
Let's get to it!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:04:58.990
Teleport.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:06.200
You fell for it again. You're simple.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.540
Why are you doing this to me?

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:13.580
Well, it's because you never set the right mood.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:17.050
That isn't what I'm after...

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:20.750
What I want is to have a date with you.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:21.750
A date?

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.720
I want to have a normal date.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.790
We can, can't we?

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.530
Yoko, sit down right there.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:30.730
I'm sitting.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.030
Okay, listen here.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:37.700
I'm a high schooler and Inukami User of the honorable Kawahiras.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.070
And you are?

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.370
Your Inukami.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:43.170
Good. And our objective is?

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.610
Vanquish evil.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.080
That is correct.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:51.610
In other words, delivering justice is our duty.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:06:00.360
There are many evils terrorizing humans.

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:04.560
Is it okay to go watch cherry blossoms?

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.060
No, it's not.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.370
Keita?

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:13.540
If our sacrifice protects people, it's worth it.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.040
Right, Yoko?

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:20.440
Keita. Forgive me. I'm...

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.480
Nah, it's okay.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:26.620
Right then, I'm off to patrol.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.520
Okay. Be careful, Keita.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.200
Oh, Keita.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:47.570
Patrol?

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:53.880
I'd rather go with a normal girl.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:57.850
Not with a puppy that breathes fires or teleports.

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.160
Hey, there.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.930
Good work on your patrol.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:18.970
So you didn't want to date <i>me.</i>

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:21.770
What? No, that's...

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.040
Darn it.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.650
Geez. You never learn, do you?

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:36.750
Evil Fire.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.960
You should be sorry.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.530
Shut up.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:55.300
It's none of your business who I date.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.870
It's a basic human right.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:02.640
Why not me?
You always ask out other girls.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:06.980
Why?

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:10.950
I prefer normal girls.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.390
I don't date dogs.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:14.760
Is that so?

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:18.960
Then, just go have fun with them.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:24.400
Beware of perverts!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.000
Elephant.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.710
Don't look at him.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.910
Yoko, you've done it again.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:40.920
Suits you well, Keita.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:46.220
Stupid dog!
Give me back my clothes.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.220
Hey, you.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:49.260
Shut up, I'm busy here.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:52.830
Hurry or you won't get dinner. Huh?

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.400
This is the 7th time, Keita Kawahira?

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.670
Come along with us.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.580
Sure is troublesome.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.580
Those people show up in spring.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:13.420
You're right.

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.080
I ask of thee.

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:24.590
Beware of perverts!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.930
Police Station

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.370
Why me?

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:34.670
Don't worry about it, bro.

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:38.270
People don't get our kind of hobby.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.110
It's not my hobby.

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:41.680
Indeed.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:47.020
But we are not doing it to be understood by others.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:51.520
It's a hobby when you carry out your beliefs.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:53.820
This isn't my hobby.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:55.760
Good evening.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.600
Hello there, Yoko.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:03.300
You sure have it hard every time.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:07.040
It sure is tough having a bad husband.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.270
A husband?

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:12.310
This is all because you left me naked.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:16.450
It's because you cheated on me.

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:19.410
You cheated? That's not good, bro.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:22.280
That is an unforgiveable act.

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:25.290
A panty thief and voyeur's telling me?

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.760
In any case, it's your fault.

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:30.030
Remember the contract?

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.030
You belong to me.

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:34.930
You'll listen to everything I say.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:39.530
Why did I make such a promise?

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:41.740
Keita.

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:44.610
Kawahira, you're released.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.750
When we meet, it's always here.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:51.850
Don't say always.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.420
You're here, so a new job, Karina?

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:01.390
Exterminating evil spirits.

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:05.830
For that, you must be a couple that gets along.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.630
A couple?

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.630
Geez. What a pain.

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:12.770
We'll pay you double.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.240
And, erase your criminal records.

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.440
Really?

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.540
It's a simple matter.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:23.650
I'm a Spiritual Investigator, acting under the Cabinet.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:26.780
Sounds good. Let's do it.

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:27.580
Really?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.250
We're going to be a couple.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:41.030
"Inukami."

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:46.470
Hey.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.340
Sorry, did you wait?

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:54.010
You're late, Keita.
You're always late.

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:57.910
Sorry, Yoko.
I'll treat you to everything.

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:01.020
That won't be enough for me to forgive you.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:01.750
Yoko.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.590
I'm sorry. You're so cold.

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:08.360
I'm a failure as a boyfriend.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:10.630
Keita.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:14.460
Oh, you're so cute, Yoko.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.800
I want to hold you tightly in my arms!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.970
What?

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.770
You are my angel. I love you.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:25.670
Hold on, this isn't in the script.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:27.440
It's ad lib.

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:28.680
No good, Kawahira.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:31.480
Just stick to the script.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.120
It's fine.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:35.980
Your script is too cliche, Karina.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:37.150
Cliche?

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.490
Inform me if you capture the target.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.360
Roger that.

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:44.360
Huh, what's up?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:49.230
You're weird.
You were so against a date before.

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:51.070
Is that so?

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:54.540
The target is Osui Eisawa.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:59.270
When alive, he was a non-selling, unpopular, poor novelist.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:00.980
What a weird outfit.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.340
Here is the problem.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:06.080
Before his death, he got this grimoire.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:09.520
With this, he can become a demon lord.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:13.290
You need desire to become one.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:15.020
An intense desire.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:19.530
During his life, he envied couples.
He was begrudgingly jealous.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.700
The grudge made him a demon lord.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.470
What powers does he have?

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:29.470
The power to turn people naked as he wants.

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:31.170
What?

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:33.110
Tell me more in detail.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.410
The power to erase people's clothes.

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:40.750
Yoko's Teleport can move an object.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.820
Eisawa's is different.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.190
He makes clothes themselves vanish.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.720
What a weirdo.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.090
How unforgivable.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:54.030
It will be dangerous to let such powers roam.

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:57.070
Let's do this, Karina.

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:01.770
I knew you'd say so.
Thanks, Kawahira.

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:05.570
You will act as a couple and lure him out.

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.940
And exterminate him.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.150
- I'm counting on you.
- You bet.

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:21.720
What is it?

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.830
This is making me a bit tense.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.630
It might be just an act,

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.800
but it's our first date.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.770
It's not an act.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:36.710
Right now, we are truly a couple.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.040
Yeah.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.060
You!

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:59.830
He's here. It's him, Eisawa.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.300
Hurray.

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:04.570
We were in such a good mood.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.010
Elephant.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:12.970
Don't look!

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:17.750
He sure is fast.

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:22.050
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:23.790
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:28.760
Stop, pervert novelist.

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.530
I ask of thee.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:35.800
Are you a warrior?
Or a fool seeking comfort?

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:38.400
You're so stupid.

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:40.800
Are you a "C" or an "S"?

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.540
"S" is the proud single.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.840
"C" is the detestable couple.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.310
Now, your answer?

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.280
Well, that's...

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:52.680
As you can see, we're totally a couple.

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.320
That doesn't matter.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:57.590
Eisawa, don't use your powers.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.990
You'll cause huge trouble if you use it here.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:05.560
Keita, it matters.
Just say we're a couple.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:09.260
To be exact, we're dog and owner.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:13.940
What? How dare you say that?
We were so in love.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.840
You guys.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:20.040
Hey, aren't you forgetting me?

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.710
How's this?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.380
Look here!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.950
Take this!

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:33.390
You're all my enemies.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:39.290
Is he using his powers?

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:40.500
Yoko.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.030
We'll defeat him before he uses it.

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.500
Wait.

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.570
Let's check it out a bit.

00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:47.870
But...

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:50.540
This is for vanquishing evil.

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:52.310
Okay.

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.210
Here it comes.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.810
Oh, no.

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:01.420
Finally the time has come.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.260
Everybody, run.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.930
This is his power. If you get hit...

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.940
You'll be like that.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:30.380
But only men.

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:31.950
What?

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.280
Wait a second.

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.420
Such a wonderful view.

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.690
Now, you feeble men.

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:42.990
Bare all to your beloved women.

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:45.730
And be totally hated by them.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.600
Keita, let's do this.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.270
What's wrong?

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.670
Why?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:54.100
Why does it only work on men?

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:55.540
Hey, Keita?

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:58.410
It should be the women, right?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.280
No, I lost my motivation.

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:09.580
Here I thought we would have a festival of naked women.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.650
Yoko, I leave the rest to you.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:13.990
Fine, I'll do it myself.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:19.130
Why are you hesitating?

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.030
I mean...

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:23.800
Get a grip. He's just a pervert.

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.030
And that's exactly why.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:27.870
I have no choice.

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:34.040
I, Spiritual Investigator Shiro Karina, shall be your opponent.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.080
Fools.

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:44.590
You women who trampled my wish of talking once with a girl.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:47.090
And you men who are popular.

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:51.890
This is my holy war to eradicate all couples.

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:54.800
Too long.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.270
You gave me false hope.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:02.200
Listen, Eisawa.
You've made 3 mistakes.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.310
First, girls like seeing their man naked.

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:10.010
